# Component rules

Every component folder contains:

- `Name.tsx`: default export, named the same as the folder and the Sitecore rendering
- `Name.types.ts`: `NameFields`, `NameParams`, `NameProps`
- `Name.mock.ts`: `mockNameProps` fixture shared by tests and stories
- `Name.test.tsx`: tests built on the mock
- `Name.module.css`: component styles (CSS modules only)
- `index.ts`: re-exports

Create components with `npm run sc:component:create -- [folder/]Name`.
Check them with `npm run sc:component:check`.
